steps.body:
Paste this into your MCP client config, then restart the client.

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "portfolio-mcp": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "@three-ws/portfolio-mcp"
      ],
      "env": {
        "SOLANA_SECRET_KEY": "<your SOLANA_SECRET_KEY>"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
